# Biz 持久化

## 禁止

```java
// ❌
import org.springframework.jdbc.core.JdbcTemplate;
import java.sql.DriverManager;
```

- `application` 包 **禁止** 注入 / 依赖 `*Mapper` 或 `com.baomidou.mybatisplus.core.mapper`
- 主数据 **禁止** 物理 `DELETE`（用逻辑删 `removeById`）

## 必须

```java
// ✅
// application.XxxService → infrastructure.XxxRepository → infrastructure.mapper.XxxMapper
@TableName("auth_user")
public class AuthUserDO extends BaseDO { /* ... */ }
```

- Entity 继承：`BaseDO` | `WorkspaceAwareDO` | `ImmutableSnapshotDO` | `AppendOnlyDO`
- Mapper 包名：`com.tioka.<domain>.infrastructure.mapper`
